# Optional: Personal medical context for AI Coach
# If set, this will be included in the AI Coach system prompt for personalized advice
# Example format - customize with your own context:
PERSONAL_MEDICAL_CONTEXT="
The user has specific health considerations:
- [Your relevant medical history]
- [Dietary requirements or restrictions]
- [Any other context for personalized coaching]
"
